    "image_with_text_3gAdyC": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_kzPNxN": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Meet our QLD Trainer",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_V3jirW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>With close to 25 years of experience in Vocational Education and Training (VET), both here in Australia and internationally, Renae brings a wealth of knowledge to every Test & Tag course. She’s all about creating a learning environment that’s not only informative but also enjoyable and hands-on. Renae is passionate about making the test and tag learning experience fun and practical, empowering each student to feel confident and capable in applying Test & Tag standards.</p><p>Whether you're just starting out or looking to refresh your skills, Renae’s goal is to help you reach your potential in a supportive and easy-to-understand way. </p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
